<speak>The layouts can feel different when you move between a larger screen and a tablet. A calm walkthrough at a separate time may be more useful than trying to remember instructions while we cover other subjects. We can arrange general help with navigating the interface without asking you to disclose any login credentials. For today, there is no need to open it. It may help to keep a short personal note of the menu path after you have found it, provided the note contains no passwords or security codes. That way you are recording the route, not storing anything sensitive beside the device.</speak>